        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi,</p><p>Just seeking clarification on one fo the Wager Matser&#39;s cards (which I can&#39;t remember the name of off the top of my head).</p><p>The card reverses the Hero turn order, so that it becomes:</p><ul><li>End of Turn</li><li>Draw</li><li>Power</li><li>Play</li><li>Sart</li></ul><p>Now, in my view this means the Hero\\&#39;s never get a turn and the Villain just keeps playing, because of End of Turn.</p><p>My friend interprest it differently saying that It&#39;[s just Power, Play and Draw that are reversed.</p><p>Again, I don&#39;t have the card in front of me so I can&#39;t qote it verbatim. &nbsp;We only played Wager Master once, and we won in the first turn by all the heros having even number of hitpoints.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Anestis.</span></p>",
